e_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":6,"y":6,"offset":5119,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":7,"y":6,"offset":5135,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":0,"y":7,"offset":5151,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":1,"y":7,"offset":5167,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":2,"y":7,"offset":5183,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":3,"y":7,"offset":5199,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":4,"y":7,"offset":5215,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":5,"y":7,"offset":5231,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":6,"y":7,"offset":5247,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"},{"x":7,"y":7,"offset":5263,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"002fc29c218c"}],"id":"wastelnd","name":"Wasteland","group":"Earth","bank":"deluxe_dnk","source_name":"WASTELND.CCT","briefing":{"environment":null,"sections":[{"index":0,"text":"Wasteland (medium)\n  This theater has one\nairstrip surrounded by\nenemy forces.  The\nsetting is a reddish\nwasteland that used\nto be Virginia before\nthe aliens arrived.","starts":[]},{"index":5,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n----------------- Welcome to RDU ^international Airport ----------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMission:      Cuckoo's Nest\nDirection:    North\nDistance:     15 mi\nDifficulty:   4\nSxyth 2087764 -99437 103308 -4000\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  Use your bombs to destroy a mindbender 15 miles north of the airstrip.\nThe bender is protected by forcefield walls and some AA.  Be careful on\nyour way out to the mission, there are some scattered enemy forces.\nEngage these if you wish, but your mission objective is the mindbender.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nMission:      Hanging Fruit\nDirection:    East\nDistance:     13 mi\nDifficulty:   4\nSxyth 596795 -2206453 300000 -32768\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n At 15,000 feet, a generator orb is providing the power for several \nKLA and AA sites.  Take out the orb, but keep an eye out for enemy\ndefenses.  Remember that your plane will not handle as well at higher\naltitudes.  Intelligence reports topnotch AA mounted precariously above\nthe orb's inverted platform.\n Take out the generator and get out of there, or else be ready to mix\nit up with the KLA.  Taking out the remaining KLA sites is optional.\nDon't forget to use your emergency rocket booster to rocket home if you\nneed to outrun some enemy deathballs!\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nMission:      The Golden Path\nDirection:    South\nDistance:     9 mi\nDifficulty:   4\nSxyth -1998440 -60304 62037 -27000\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  To the south lies a fuel dump facility arrange in a line.  This setup\nis just begging for an air attack!  Blow all those fuel tanks to \nkingdom come.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMission:      The Halls of Malevolence\nDirection:    West\nDistance:     12 mi\nDifficulty:   5\nSxyth 176300 1428960 185161 19000\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  The aliens have quite a nice setup out to the west of our postion.\nThe orders from the brass are to go out there and help them redecorate.\nTake out the orb to bring the walls down, then get the heck out of\nthere if the defenses are still up.\n  It is a long haul back to the airstrip from there, so you might want\nto stick around and take out those topnotch KLA sites which will\npopup during your attack.  Otherwise you may be playing tag with ace\ndeathballs all the way home.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","st